# OS and editor artifacts
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.claude
**/.codex
**/.trash/
**/*.swp
# AI resume files
resume.sh
resume.txt
# Python artifacts
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/__pycache__/
# Environment secrets
.env
.env.*
# AI project worktrees. These live inside the repo, so without this rule every
# file in one shows up as untracked here and could be committed to main by
# accident — the exact mistake the worktree exists to prevent.
**/ai-wt/
